+- heterogeneity and round-budget diagnostics.
+
+The key machine-readable outputs are `summary.csv`, `proposal_ablation.csv`,
+`pareto_frontier.csv`, `literature_individual_summary.csv`, and
+`literature_baselines.csv`.
